# yaml-language-server: $schema=https://aka.ms/winget-manifest.defaultLocale.1.12.0.schema.json
#
# winget locale manifest for the CITAR helper: everything a person sees in `winget show`. Written by
# scripts/release_checksums.py from this template.

PackageIdentifier: JimmieRodgers.CITAR.Helper
PackageVersion: {{version}}
PackageLocale: en-US
Publisher: Jimmie Rodgers
PublisherUrl: https://github.com/jprodgers
PublisherSupportUrl: https://github.com/jprodgers/CITAR/issues
PackageName: CITAR helper
PackageUrl: https://github.com/jprodgers/CITAR/blob/main/docs/server/WORKERS.md
License: MPL-2.0
LicenseUrl: https://github.com/jprodgers/CITAR/blob/main/LICENSE
Copyright: Copyright (c) Jimmie Rodgers and contributors
ShortDescription: Lend this machine's model endpoint, and its spare CPU if you choose, to a CITAR server
Description: |-
  The CITAR helper connects this machine to a CITAR server, a Civilization V-style 4X game whose
  players can be language models. It dials out to the server and serves its model requests from an
  endpoint on this machine, such as LM Studio, Ollama, llama.cpp or vLLM, so nothing needs to be
  reachable from the internet. If you choose, it also plays the server's lab games on this
  machine's spare CPU.

  Run `citar-helper setup` with a token from whoever runs the server. This build is updated by
  winget (`winget upgrade JimmieRodgers.CITAR.Helper`) and never updates itself.
Moniker: citar-helper
Tags:
  - ai
  - benchmark
  - citar
  - llm
  - lm-studio
  - ollama
ReleaseNotesUrl: https://github.com/jprodgers/CITAR/releases/tag/v{{version}}
# Documentations, not Documentation (packaging/README.md).
Documentations:
  - DocumentLabel: The CITAR helper
    DocumentUrl: https://github.com/jprodgers/CITAR/blob/main/docs/server/WORKERS.md
ManifestType: defaultLocale
ManifestVersion: 1.12.0
